{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36454","headline":"题笙 · 罗邺","name":"题笙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"筠管参差排凤翅，月堂凄切胜龙吟。\n最宜轻动纤纤玉，醉送当观灩灩金。\n缑岭独能徵妙曲，嬴台相共吹清音。\n好将宫徵陪歌扇，莫遣新声郑卫侵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36454.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36454","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}